roperly (reduced by Cunning).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"火箭靴有%d%%几率失败（随灵巧降低）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"96566e4077d1e9092701703f1ef764347655b773b846491231c977a94adcf5a4","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e01d2897e8d4fd587e2f6b29b9bda92889a53bc4f924259c7e37be193f3a7268","logical_entry_identity":"e0fe1d33adcae3355eaa2338d38a16ad459be432955c94118e49af07fcc0310c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"%s unstoppable force salve","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s 势不可挡药剂"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4bc20a21996d25156aef2632b4b82066a5d93443808e9722daf18b95b4120a22","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e0273d032a693d3358f9700fd888fb79c543201ede6c12dd47728b31906971ef","logical_entry_identity":"711ff9277df7099eece0295f4236b65bffa259a6d3422ff5a3b6196e27457b39","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#AQUAMARINE#You overtake the yeti's mind and order it to report to Kruk Pride.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#AQUAMARINE#你控制了雪人的思维，将其送往克鲁克部落。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d19b7a10606f29a6cdb8691f600cb0b6c11187ee780331ed2caff9249c048f50","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e02d6bcc1ae911f14899f185946e433bc3ad9fc34dc88d5c40cff9c56e5f12f9","logical_entry_identity":"b6cd594430a8dcb6a311fd82452ffacc5d5685f1034d9652d1378707c4f30d82","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"steam generator implant","source_tag":"entity name","target":"蒸汽机植入物"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bb99f8ce06b10c3d5635014e95edee0c8f5e2b5bb3dfb834c72d6690ea4b8650","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e03b2f9412b86050b6fdaa1766b96b6fcd9dbc4a461483af33e9c01a7750a30b","logical_entry_identity":"30b21f6295cac2f44bb9aca9b61f60defb2cd25c8fac8ef81fd05cca2fdb35a0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"light","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"光系"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"40fdc5396d30870938f59f467fd2b9505631215ee7a93c5cacaaa684d83fd572","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e03daa132548eff47fc6e1668d22db20383d8a7ff3f46f80f387c25b52e5ee0e","logical_entry_identity":"15751a3a0ac71643c44bf3fac36a692d89f8cab198473719eb066e77646b0bd7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Originally a kitchen implement used by the giants to saw through tough, frozen carcasses. Something is especially sinister about this example though.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这原本是巨人用来锯开坚硬冰冻兽尸的厨具，但这一把却透着格外邪恶的气息。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9f43576590168502bc4c77039ec4ca979912f40167cddd389aea9b17b57dfad3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e07c608f537f51397025aea70159c225f2f40c26f46c13e33ff60dd10e21f678","logical_entry_identity":"031d1556e66214d72a88d0e38747da2dda40aa6f6d5da8d40ec74075bcb0069e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Sends a lightly electrified net of radius 2 toward a target, all creatures caught inside will be pinned in place for 5 turns.\n\t\tWhile the electricity is not enough to do damage it does shock their body, reducing all resistances by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"向目标发射一张半径 2 格的轻微带电网，范围内的所有生物会被定身 5 回合。\n\t\t电流虽不足以造成伤害，却会电击它们的身体，使所有抗性降低 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0011c6f4af6571b497e62fbffb8febffcc713e4e0453be085c4c8b65358778af","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e0ac27c22ff8ccbbe69565ad68caa77032bdcadcaa61de2d98bbc6ad0c4633b6","logical_entry_identity":"2b522693c9900ff389a9d1f3b45b7f3607cff4cbc8c671c0d57a04a0bf86e006","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Mirror Image (%s)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"镜像 (%s)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f287c03fb617d999f69f526d77672849cc3d9be2ee98a2370fe94c141445967d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e0ce47f510a5f8ebb92ac57fec448feb17b2a6aa5e849e097d59ec5bb224e793","logical_entry_identity":"99b4e36ed3a84c809a8135bc5a6d9742a9af618cc00c7a081f46d1f4ee8a5034","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The foolish creations of the lesser gods have simply handed me Your mouth, in return for a few of the apostates' trinkets!  Unearthed by Dwarves, brought from a distant land by Humans, offered to me by Trolls...  None were aware of how they were helping You, so do not spare these humanoids Your wrath.  They deserve cleansing as much as the Giants, Elves, and other creatures from the lesser gods, creatures that still refuse Your blessing.\n\nThe Giants are beginning to falter, as the creations of the pettier gods inevitably do.  As amusing as it would have been to watch them demonstrate their inferiority by tearing at each others' throats, the Orcs have brought them ruin and pushed them to desperation even sooner.  They will reconsider my offer, and then...  ","source_tag":"_t","target":"那些劣等神祇的愚蠢造物，就这样简单地把你的嘴交到了我的手上，而它们想要的仅仅是一堆背教者的小玩具！被矮人发现，被人类从遥远的土地上带来，被巨魔交到了我的手中……他们中间没有人知道自己是在帮助你，所以也不要怜惜对这些家伙释放你的愤怒。他们和巨人、精灵以及其他劣等神祇的造物，那些仍然拒绝你的祝福的生物，只配得到彻底的清除。\n\n那些巨人开始动摇了，这就是弱小神祇的造物不可避免的命运。虽然看着他们互相撕开彼此的喉咙、暴露自己的卑劣与渺小会很有趣，但兽人却更早给他们带来了毁灭，将他们逼入绝境。他们一定会重新考虑我的提议，然后……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec6bbe299dcea295e1cabe7c42288908d2bd1d459d1e2218470106d00b6a046d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e0dcb28da4fbb3738405986dc803c1fb414887c4d62ec6f74d8717aae2e55644","logical_entry_identity":"85366b2519651603dadb560dcaf65425cf04df72e1a1cca5d7702fb3195f7772","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"booty chest","source_tag":"entity name","target":"战利品箱子"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4f8599fbaca1b85ddc265582d1e6bfcb45dc023c3e39aa1a73115e025add8b12","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e0e08f37c2331c2288e55de6f8ef42c57320ccf103586bcd4e84867bb6c7a7e3","logical_entry_identity":"a40b2ecac804c413a8afb8ae091adcbf826fd5f5e876e5a102e4008bb3b00e0d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Target#'s dark aura fades.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#的黑暗领域消退了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"96e0f88a7c09e9e037ec0c5ef993c52e3a1a2f0d7d42cf1858d638cca7741c5d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"e0e2980bf8e5db2f13b13ee284e08490b20f351d51338bba8dd21f5f9a00ed1f","logical_entry_identity":"594c